From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: suckbluefrog <suckbluefrog@proton.me>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +000
Subject: [PATCH] AdaptiveUtils: include cstdint

AdaptiveUtils.h uses uint16_t and uint64_t directly. Newer toolchains no
longer provide these transitively through the existing include set in all
translation units, so include <cstdint> explicitly.

Upstream: Not submitted
Signed-off-by: suckbluefrog <suckbluefrog@proton.me>
---
 src/common/AdaptiveUtils.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/common/AdaptiveUtils.h b/src/common/AdaptiveUtils.h
--- a/src/common/AdaptiveUtils.h
+++ b/src/common/AdaptiveUtils.h
@@ -8,6 +8,7 @@
 #pragma once
 
 #include <algorithm>
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <limits>
 #include <memory>
 #include <string_view>
-- 
